{"id": "ea990f99b854e51b036282dc519951bf", "text": "and fill the mind with issues related to the Lord. This ensures that the mind \nwill gradually focus on the Lord and move away from worldly matters.  \n \n\u00e0em\u00ddV_Zg\u00a7 \u00f8oZ\u00a7 `mo{JZ\u00a7 gwI_w\u00cem __\u00b2 \u0178& \nCn\u00a1{V em\u00ddVaOg\u00a7 ~\u00ab\u00f7^yV_H$\u00eb_f_\u00b2 \u0178&& 27 &&  \n \nHigh level of happiness will accrue to a yogi who has a tranquil mind \ndevoid of  passionate qualities (such as  obsession and aversion ), and who is \nfocused on the Lord. This is a well -known fact. (6.27)", "embedding": [0.04916559159755707, 0.054445601999759674, 0.06014334037899971, 0.017227817326784134, 0.007575770374387503, 0.010770549066364765, 0.09310410171747208, -0.035459909588098526, 0.07524796575307846, -0.02119874209165573, 0.007608378771692514, 0.0029055147897452116, -0.024249006062746048, -0.03839338943362236, 0.11460226774215698, -0.006751609034836292, -0.06218194589018822, 0.03629845380783081, -0.06480139493942261, -0.026181116700172424, -0.002806686330586672, 0.05152947083115578, 0.04434257000684738, -0.07088419049978256, -0.052657246589660645, -0.005131825339049101, 0.02677697315812111, -0.01489848643541336, 0.05771811679005623, -0.0194920152425766, 0.07703664898872375, 0.03864225000143051, 0.007866254076361656, 0.013515430502593517, -0.08683089166879654, 0.06451430916786194, -0.020723426714539528, 0.021962890401482582, 0.052405379712581635, -0.09654577821493149, 0.03165451064705849, 0.06663097441196442, 0.03348803520202637, -0.053922683000564575, -0.019035164266824722, -0.029785411432385445, -0.04342907294631004, 0.014583430252969265, 0.05276753380894661, -0.06820780783891678, -0.08537822216749191, -0.019342172890901566, -0.017568545415997505, -0.006434023380279541, 0.01283129584044218, 0.08278025686740875, -0.02078152634203434, -0.005164665170013905, -0.033572133630514145, 0.06093783304095268, -0.05262896046042442, 0.050951335579156876, 0.05093234032392502, 0.01778028532862